1.A person says I have a horse ,whose color may be brown ,grey or black.A,B,
C are given each 
A) the color is mot black
B) the color is either grey or brown
C) the color is brown.
One of these is at least true and one is wrong .Identify
Ans.A & B r correct ,C is false grey is the color

